# 03 - Two scenes, one session. Switch between them to arm different
# combinations of actors at once. This is the Kanopi differentiator: a
# structural sequencer on top of any runtime.
#
# How to play it:
#   1. Both actor bodies open in tabs. Evaluate them once (Ctrl+Enter in
#      each block) so each actor's code is loaded.
#   2. In the right panel, open the Scenes view.
#   3. Click `calm` - only the drums are armed; the lead stops.
#   4. Click `full` - drums + lead play together.
#   5. Shortcut: Alt+1 = first scene (calm), Alt+2 = second (full).
#      The active scene is highlighted in amber.
#   6. Ctrl+. hushes every runtime at once.

@actor drums 03-drums.strudel strudel
@actor lead  03-lead.strudel  strudel

@scene calm drums
@scene full drums lead
